<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ SPORT, RUGBY UNION - Fisher replaces Guy as NZRFU chairman.</title>
<headline>NZ SPORT, RUGBY UNION - Fisher replaces Guy as NZRFU chairman.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rob Fisher was elected chairman of the New Zealand Rugby Football Union on Wednesday, replacing Richie Guy.</p>
<p>Radio NZ said John Spicer of Otago would be Fisher's deputy.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 473-4746</p>
</text>
